fsis.usda.gov/ophs/Microlab/Mlgchp6.pdf">http://www.fsis.usda.gov/ophs/Microlab/Mlgchp6.pdf</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B27"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Lior</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><article-title>New extended biotyping scheme for <italic>Campylobacter jejuni</italic>, <italic>Campylobacter coli</italic>, and <italic>Campylobacter laridis</italic></article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source><year>1984</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>636</fpage><lpage>640</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6490850</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>